is also impractical to advise WWF to build its own forces for wildlife crime fighting. Many illegal
                    号




IWT criminals are armed fully, the work of crime crackdown must have a tight connection with
other institutions with military forces. Additionally, IWT crimes are always cross-boarders, making
           信




